# WP-055 golden: Mirror Ward absorbs 40% of the next 3 hits (record with `lf-tools replay record-script`). Each line:
# <ticks> <move_x> <move_z> [BUTTONS], plus `cmd` lines. The player rests at the Lantern,
# raises Insight by 8 (the spell's requirement), attunes the spell to the first
# attunement slot (slot 32), and casts it. Stylus, Glimmer, and known spells come from
# the `spell_ward` scenario.
seed 5505
scenario spell_ward
10 0 0            # settle on the ground
cmd Rest
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd LevelUp 5
cmd Equip 32 15004      # attune
2 0 0
1 0 0 LIGHT     # cast the ward
45 0 0
60 0 127        # run toward the Husk: it notices at 14 m and walks up
300 0 0         # it swings its combo, and again
